\boxed{1}

Based on my review of the three episode transcripts provided, Bigby's Hand was cast only once across all episodes.

This occurs in the first episode when Scanlan casts Bigby's Hand to push the giant goliath Duke Vedmeyer off a roof during the battle at his estate in Whitestone. The spell is used to shove Vedmeyer off the rooftop, and he falls and takes falling damage.

Looking at the first episode provided, the first spell cast is **Pass Without a Trace**, cast by Vex'ahlia (Laura).

This occurs near the beginning of the episode when the party is trying to stealth into Whitestone city. Laura says: "I'll cast Pass Without a Trace on all of us" as they prepare to enter the city while disguised with the Seeming spell.

\boxed{Pass Without a Trace}
